DESCRIPTION >
    Hourly rollup of Tool Event mix and outcomes, by org/source/tool/command_family/repo.
    Powers the failure leaderboard and period-over-period delta. Rebuilt from
    agent_tool_events FINAL (Copy Pipe, COPY_MODE replace) — never appended per replay.
    Success/Failure/Unknown counts kept separate so failure_rate can exclude unknown
    from the denominator while still counting it.

SCHEMA >
    `BucketStart` DateTime,
    `OrgId` String,
    `source` LowCardinality(String),
    `tool_name` LowCardinality(String),
    `command_family` LowCardinality(String),
    `repo_fingerprint` String,
    `EventCount` AggregateFunction(count),
    `SuccessCount` AggregateFunction(sum, UInt64),
    `FailureCount` AggregateFunction(sum, UInt64),
    `UnknownCount` AggregateFunction(sum, UInt64),
    `DurationMsSum` AggregateFunction(sum, UInt64)

ENGINE "AggregatingMergeTree"
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "BucketStart, OrgId, source, tool_name, command_family, repo_fingerprint"
ENGINE_PARTITION_KEY "toYYYYMM(BucketStart)"
ENGINE_TTL "BucketStart + toIntervalYear(1)"
